WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.801
First week at a new job. You told your journal all of it: the nerves, the coffee, the lunch.

2
00:00:09.101 --> 00:00:13.424
Your mom would love to hear it in your voice. Not all of it, just the good part.

3
00:00:14.724 --> 00:00:21.200
Tap Share, then Trim a clip. Send it all, or drag the ends to just that moment.

4
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.817
It arrives as a short video she can just tap to play. Your entry stays whole.

5
00:00:28.117 --> 00:00:33.328
And the line about your new friend? Hold it, and send it to her as text.

6
00:00:34.627 --> 00:00:38.787
Only the piece you pick leaves your phone. Share is on every entry.
